# Build output from the four toolchains this directory drives. The lockfiles beside these are
# committed on purpose: the Dockerfile pins the toolchains and the lockfiles pin what they
# resolved to, which is what makes a number in the README reproducible rather than a number
# from whatever happened to be current that day.
rust/target/
js/node_modules/
clojure/.cpcache/
python/__pycache__/
